# Text to scene: Code generator using intermidiate representation IR 
- This project is my undergraduate theses and aims to generate executable Python code for the Elements graphics framework 
from structured scene representations.
- The current system uses hierarchical Intermediate Representation (IR) and a code generator to produce runnable 3D scenes

 ## Current Features

 - Hierarchical scene representation (scene tree)
 - Deterministic code generator for the Elements framework
 - Support for:
    - scene nodes 
    - group nodes
    - mesh_objects nodes
- Geometry factory support for: 
    - cube 
    - rechtagnular prism 
    - plane
    - sphere
    - cylinder
    - cone
    - pyramid
    - triangular_pyramid
- Composite site sctructures using groups
- Prefab scene composition (house, tree, box, street light)

